### Register a user
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "daniel",
  "password": "12345",
  "email": "",
  "first_name": "Daniel",
  "last_name": "Gómez"
}


### Login - Valid credentials
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "daniel",
    "password": "12345"
}


### Login - Inactive user
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "daniel",
    "password": "12345"
}